%% Policy approval workflow — state machine (ADR-120)
%% Render: https://mermaid.live or the repo's architecture-diagram.html pattern
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Published: existing & new policies (approved_externally=true)
  Published --> Draft: configure approvers
  Draft --> InReview: submit (expand groups, freeze members)
  ChangesRequested --> InReview: resubmit (fresh run, re-resolve groups)
  Rejected --> InReview: resubmit
  Published --> InReview: submit (re-approval of a new version)
  InReview --> InReview: step satisfied, more steps remain
  InReview --> Approved: final step satisfied (approved_version set)
  InReview --> ChangesRequested: request-changes (+comment)
  InReview --> Rejected: reject (+comment)
  InReview --> Draft: withdraw
  Approved --> Published: publish
  InReview --> Published: approve-externally (admin break-glass)
  Draft --> Published: approve-externally (admin)
